<article class="env-lemma" id="00OI">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00OI">Lemma <span data-tag="00OI">10.112.2</span>.</a> Suppose that $R \to S$ is a ring map with the going up property, see Definition <a href="/tag/00HV" data-tag="00HV">10.41.1</a>. If $\mathfrak q \subset S$ is a maximal ideal. Then the inverse image of $\mathfrak q$ in $R$ is a maximal ideal too. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Trivial. 
